Dear Olivia,

It has come to my attention that you might think your mother is a little annoying? Kooky and crazy. I wonder if you ever spend time looking in the mirror and think to yourself, jeez.... we are kind of both similar. 

Did you notice you both were Evil?

That's really great news.

Signed 
Your mother,
Mom